      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-q89252\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 1</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Simplify the sentence \"The movie is romantic, or the movie is romantic or comic.\"</p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-89252-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The movie is romantic and comic</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-89252-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The movie is romantic but not comic</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-89252-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The movie is romantic or comic</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-89252-d\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">d</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The movie is romantic </td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-89252-e\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The movie is comic</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p></p><p>First, let's rewrite the phrase \"the movie is romantic or comic\" as the equivalent phrase \"the movie is romantic or the movie is comic.\" The sentence now reads</p><p></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The movie is romantic, or the movie is romantic or the movie is comic.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Then, using the associative law, we can move the comma:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The movie is romantic or the movie is romantic, or the movie is comic.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Now, we can simplify the phrase \"The movie is romantic or the movie is romantic\" to just \"The movie is romantic.\" The sentence now reads</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The movie is romantic, or the movie is comic.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Finally, we can write the sentence more concisely as</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The movie is romantic or comic.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div></div>",
