      "html": "<div id=\"step-q89251\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 5</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Simplify the sentence \"The dress is red and elegant, and it is elegant.\"</p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-89251-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The dress is elegant</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-89251-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The dress is red </td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-89251-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The dress is red and it is not elegant</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-89251-d\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">d</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The dress is red or elegant</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-89251-e\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">The dress is red and elegant</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p></p><p>First, let's rewrite the phrase \"The dress is red and elegant\" as the equivalent phrase \"The dress is red and the dress is elegant.\" The sentence now reads</p><p></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The dress is red and the dress is elegant, and it is elegant.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Then, using the associative law, we can move the comma:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The dress is red, and the dress is elegant and it is elegant.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Now, we can simplify the phrase \"the dress is elegant and it is elegant\" to just \"the dress is elegant.\" The sentence now reads</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The dress is red, and the dress is elegant.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Finally, we can write the sentence more concisely as</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"The dress is red and elegant.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div></div>",
