    "q-83008": {
      "dom_id": "step-q83008",
      "name": "Question 12",
      "problem": "Simplify the following sentence: \"The watch is a wristwatch, or it is a pocket watch or it is a wristwatch.\"",
      "worked_solution": "Using the commutative law, we can replace the phrase \"it is a pocket watch or it is a wristwatch\" with the phrase \"it is a wristwatch or it is a pocket watch.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The watch is a wristwatch, or it is a wristwatch or it is a pocket watch.\"\n\nThen, using the associative law, we can move the comma:\n\n\"The watch is a wristwatch or it is a wristwatch, or it is a pocket watch.\"\n\nNow, we can simplify the phrase \"The watch is a wristwatch or it is a wristwatch\" to just \"The watch is a wristwatch.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The watch is a wristwatch, or it is a pocket watch.\"\n\nFinally, we can write the sentence more concisely:\n\n\"The watch is a wristwatch or a pocket watch.\"",
