      "name": "Question 14",
      "problem": "Identify the sentence that is equivalent to the following: \"$6$ is divisible by $2$ and it is divisible by $3.$\"",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's write the sentence more concisely:\n\n\"$6$ is divisible by $2$ and $3.$\"\n\nUsing the commutative law, we can swap the order of the numbers \"$2$\" and \" $3.$\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"$6$ is divisible by $3$ and $2.$\"",
