      "name": "Question 15",
      "problem": "Identify the sentence that is equivalent to the following: \"The juice is strawberry or it is orange.\"",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's write the sentence more concisely:\n\n\"The juice is strawberry or orange.\"\n\nUsing the commutative law, we can swap the order of the words \"strawberry\" and \"orange.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The juice is orange or strawberry.\"",
