      "name": "Question 17",
      "problem": "Simplify $(A∨B)∨A.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the commutative, associative, and idempotent laws, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A∨B)∨A & ≡(B∨A)∨A \\\\  & ≡B∨(A∨A) \\\\  & ≡B∨A.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
