      "name": "Question 20",
      "problem": "Simplify $(A∧A)∧(B∧A).$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the associative, commutative, and idempotent laws, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A∧A)∧(B∧A) & ≡A∧(B∧A) \\\\  & ≡A∧(A∧B) \\\\  & ≡(A∧A)∧B \\\\  & ≡A∧B.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
